### Get not found 404
GET http://localhost:3000/notfound

### GET all items
GET http://localhost:3000/items

### GET an item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/items/2

### GET false item by id
GET http://localhost:3000/items/999

### POST new item
POST http://localhost:3000/items
content-type: application/json

{"name": "uusi postattu itemi"}

